ACM here at UIUC is working on a game called Realms of Darkness.
Its more like Ultima V than nethack supposedly though.  (Instead
of ascii charcters, the positions are graphic icons)  Its supposed
to be run over the net, with net-connected macintoshes being the first
client theyre going to develop for.  But its a real-time, multi-player
with all play taking place in the same world controlled by a server.
Last I heard developement had run to a standstill after alot of work
done by one guy.

